<title>INDIA: India's RBI sets 14-day repos cut-off at 5.48 pct.</title>
<headline>India's RBI sets 14-day repos cut-off at 5.48 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it set a cut-off of 5.48 percent at the 14-day repos auction of government of India securities held earlier in the day.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received 22 bids for 7.25 billion rupees of which it accepted one for three billion rupees.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
